com/bseplus/AnnualReport/542597/75920542597.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2021","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/542597/71465542597_11_09_21.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2020","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/542597/65731542597_23_12_20.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2019","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/542597/5425970319.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2018","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/HIS_ANN_RPT/HISTANNR/2018/MSTC_LTD-542597-MARCH-2018.PDF","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2017","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/HIS_ANN_RPT/HISTANNR/2017/MSTC_LTD-542597-MARCH-2017.PDF","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2016","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/HIS_ANN_RPT/HISTANNR/2016/MSTC_LTD-542597-MARCH-2016.PDF","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2015","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/HIS_ANN_RPT/HISTANNR/2015/MSTC_LTD-542597-MARCH-2015.PDF","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2014","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/HIS_ANN_RPT/HISTANNR/2014/MSTC_LTD-542597-MARCH-2014.PDF","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2013","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/HIS_ANN_RPT/HISTANNR/2013/MSTC_LTD-542597-MARCH-2013.PDF","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2012","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/HIS_ANN_RPT/HISTANNR/2012/MSTC_LTD-542597-MARCH-2012.PDF","source":"bse"}],"analysis":{"summary":"MSTC Limited reported a strong Q1 FY27 performance with revenue from operations reaching Rs. 94.25 crores, driven by record Q1 e-commerce revenue and an improved EBITDA percentage. The company successfully exited its legacy trading and marketing segment in FY26 and is focusing on asset-light digital solutions, including new initiatives like an electronic trading platform for EPR certificates, a travel portal, and a TReDS platform. Management noted that its joint venture with Mahindra (MMRPL) turned profitable this quarter, supported by higher feedstock inflows. Additionally, the company is exploring opportunities in coal and mineral exchanges while maintaining its core e-commerce and auction businesses.","themes":{"guidance":[{"claim":"Management stated that the company aims to maintain an average double-digit growth rate over a longer period.","quote":"So, our aim is to maintain a double-digit number.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf"},{"claim":"Management stated that the attempt shall be to maintain a double-digit growth in e-commerce if possible.","quote":"It would not be fair to put a number to it, but the attempt shall be to maintain a double-digit growth if possible.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c6a605d6-952c-4918-aa03-944027cb0941.pdf"}],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"Management stated that scrap sales remain cyclical with volumes and rates fluctuating over time.","quote":"The steel sector as such is very cyclical. So, the rates keep going up and down. And the volume of scrap, that also keeps changing from time to time.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf"},{"claim":"Management expects the positive trend in feedstock inflows and financial outlook for the Mahindra joint venture to strengthen and continue.","quote":"And we expect this trend to strengthen and continue, driving towards a healthy financial outlook for this company.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf"},{"claim":"Management noted that the flow of vehicles through the MSTC portal would increase once policy frameworks and incentives are available.","quote":"And once those are available, those are available to people, the flow of vehicles through the MSTC portal would also increase.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c6a605d6-952c-4918-aa03-944027cb0941.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[{"claim":"Management stated that the company took a decision to remain an asset-light entity.","quote":"We also took a decision to remain an asset-light company.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf"},{"claim":"Management noted that the company has completed the development of the electronic trading platform for EPR certificates and is awaiting a go-ahead.","quote":"So, as a part of that development of the electronic trading platform for EPR certificates is now complete along with all the integrations necessary for immediate operationalization. We are now awaiting the go ahead for being able to start operating this portal for trading and settlement of EPR certificates from all notified sectors by the stakeholders.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf"},{"claim":"Management stated that the travel portal mstcsmarttravel.in is under operationalization for the B2B segment with a B2C rollout planned shortly.","quote":"Similarly, our team has been working towards developing MSTC\u2019s travel portal at mstcsmarttravel.in. This is under operationalization for the B2B segment with B2C rollout planned shortly.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf"}],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"Management reported that the EBITDA percentage of total income was 69.05% for Q1 FY27.","quote":"EBITDA percentage of total income was 69.05%, also nearly 3% higher than the corresponding period of FY26.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf"},{"claim":"Management reported that revenue from operations increased by nearly 22% year-on-year to Rs. 94.25 crores in Q1 FY27.","quote":"Revenue from operations has been Rs. 94.25 crores, which is a nearly 22% year-on-year increase over the corresponding period last year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf"},{"claim":"Standalone EBITDA was INR 81.49 crore in 2026-27-Q1 compared to INR 61.88 crore in 2025-26-Q1.","quote":"EBITDA of INR 81.49 crore in 2026-27-Q1 vis-\u00e0-vis INR 61.88 crore in 2025-26-Q1.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=453eafe2-cf15-4469-bad8-0c92f3007ac3.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"Management reported the highest ever Q1 e-commerce revenue of Rs. 89.49 crores.","quote":"Riding on the highest ever Q1 e-commerce revenue of Rs. 89.49 crores, this is the highest in the Q1 since your company was listed in 2019 March.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf"}],"capital_allocation":[{"claim":"Management announced the complete exit from the trading and marketing segment in FY26 and the recovery of dues on the 110% BG model during the quarter.","quote":"We had taken a decision in FY26 to completely exit from the trading and marketing segment and have seamlessly recovered our dues on the 110% BG model, closing the chapter on this legacy segment in this quarter.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf"},{"claim":"Management announced the decision to exit the 110% BG business, which will be out of the business basket by the first quarter of the year.","quote":"And there is a thing, that the positive part that we are now even exiting from the 110% BG that was fully secured but still choose to have a focused approach towards e-commerce domain. So we have decided to exit, and by the first quarter of this year it will be out of our business basket.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c6a605d6-952c-4918-aa03-944027cb0941.pdf"}],"risks_headwinds":[{"claim":"Management noted that scrap is a cyclical business where rates and volumes keep going up and down.","quote":"The steel sector as such is very cyclical. So, the rates keep going up and down. And the volume of scrap, that also keeps changing from time to time.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf"}]},"management_commitments":[{"claim":"Management stated that the TReDS platform is expected to be operationalized sometime during FY27, subject to regulatory approvals.","quote":"This project is also at an advanced stage and subject to regulatory approvals being obtained, we should be able to operationalize this sometime during this FY27.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf","timeframe":"FY27"},{"claim":"Management stated an internal target to hopefully obtain RBI approval and operationalize the TReDS platform within FY27.","quote":"So, our internal target is hopefully FY27, within FY27.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf","timeframe":"FY27"},{"claim":"MSTC is developing a TREDs platform and has applied to RBI for requisite clearance.","quote":"MSTC is developing a TREDs platform and has applied to RBI for requisite clearance.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=453eafe2-cf15-4469-bad8-0c92f3007ac3.pdf","timeframe":""},{"claim":"ETP for EPR certification has been developed on behalf of CPCB and is awaiting go ahead for operation.","quote":"ETP for EPR certification has been developed on behalf of CPCB and is awaiting go ahead for operation.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=453eafe2-cf15-4469-bad8-0c92f3007ac3.pdf","timeframe":""},{"claim":"Management stated that the travel portal is expected to be operationalized shortly in the B2B space.","quote":"This portal is also in its final stages of testing, and we expect to operationalize it shortly in the B2B space to begin with, and then extend segmental reach as we gain traction.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c6a605d6-952c-4918-aa03-944027cb0941.pdf","timeframe":""}],"coverage":{"docs_analysed":3,"kinds":["concall_transcript","concall_ppt"]}},"_meta":{"model":"gemini-3.6-flash","grounded":true,"facts_kept":20,"facts_dropped_ungrounded":4,"note":"Facts are verbatim-grounded against the company's own documents; claims whose quote was not found were dropped."}}